  "contentval": "0001ezzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evQm/102",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">안녕하세요</span><br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">이번에 재과만 행사를 갔다가,&#160;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">김민성선생님을 통해 오랜만에 상대성이론 관련하여 강연을 들을 수있어</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">저도 이를 코딩으로 시뮬레이션할 수 있지 않을까 싶어 만들어보았습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">프로그램은&#160; 역시 VPython을 사용했습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">c언어를 미약하게....아주 미약하게 아는 저로서는 이런 시뮬레이션으로는 가장 편한 듯하여 사용하고 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><a href=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.glowscript.org/</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Web VPython\" data-og-description=\"VPython is an easy-to-use, powerful environment for creating 3D animations. Here at glowscript.org (or webvpython.org, which takes you here), you can write and run VPython programs right in your browser, store them in the cloud for free, and easily share t\" data-og-host=\"www.glowscript.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" data-og-url=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cUXbKo/hyU8469ejQ/P13nCJjfeCG0daD5dTSCn0/img.jpg?width=368&amp;height=392&amp;face=0_0_368_392\"><a href=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.glowscript.org/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cUXbKo/hyU8469ejQ/P13nCJjfeCG0daD5dTSCn0/img.jpg?width=368&amp;height=392&amp;face=0_0_368_392\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Web VPython</p><p class=\"og-desc\">VPython is an easy-to-use, powerful environment for creating 3D animations. Here at glowscript.org (or webvpython.org, which takes you here), you can write and run VPython programs right in your browser, store them in the cloud for free, and easily share t</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.glowscript.org</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">1. 마이컬슨 몰리 실험</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">위 공이 지나가는 곳은 간섭계입니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">위 간섭계에 표시해놓은 것처럼 </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">수평방향으로 움직일때 속력을 붉은색, 수직 방향으로 움직일때 속력을&#160; 노란색으로 그래프에 나타나며,</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">첫번째 그래프는 에테르(에테르 속력 2/3 c) 가 있다고 가정했을때, 두번째 그래프는 에테르가 없을때(빛의 속력 일정) 입니다.</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/RoMMURGh7zg\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/RoMMURGh7zg</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RoMMURGh7zg\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"869\" data-video-height=\"489\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cTfwqh/hyU8ZSjmur/L6EOUF3nDNGsZr8udM7N5K/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RoMMURGh7zg\" width=\"869\" height=\"489\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">마이컬슨 몰리 실험</div></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">다만, 에테르가 있고, 수직방향으로 움직일때 속력을 다음과 같이 가볍게 계산했는데...</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">혹시 틀린 점이 있다면 말씀 부탁드립니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fc26e5899ef770ce216693ea995ab4e10dd9b06\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fc26e5899ef770ce216693ea995ab4e10dd9b06\" data-origin-width=\"1082\" data-origin-height=\"622\"><div class=\"figcaption\">에테르 있을 때 수직방향으로 움직이는 빛</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">2. 시간팽창</span></p><p>붉은 색은 정지계, 노란 색은 움직이는 계로 나타냈습니다.</p><p>계의 속력을 바꾸면, 시간간격이 붉은색에 비해 얼마나 달라지는지 시각화 할 수 있도록 만들었습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/cvVuQ4mPYYw\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/cvVuQ4mPYYw</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cvVuQ4mPYYw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"852\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hSytI/hyU838e5Gj/DtKfRH4wzRVwpQtU3R6Usk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"852\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cvVuQ4mPYYw\" width=\"852\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\">시간팽창</div></div><p>역시 부족한 점이 있으면 많은 조언 부탁드립니다 ㅠㅠ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>추가로... 시공간 그래프를 만들어보고자 하는데, 딱히 어떤 활용도가 있을지... 잘 모르겠습니다...</p><p>좋은 의견 있으시면 (이런이런거 해볼 수 있으면 좋겠다! 등) 말씀부탁드립니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28364496106dc1b98739c1b3fdab187e108be784?download\" data-file-name=\"마이컬슨 몰리 실험.txt\" data-file-size=\"3000\" data-mimetype=\"text/plain\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevQm%26dataid%3D102%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20240123121129&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F28364496106dc1b98739c1b3fdab187e108be784')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">마이컬슨 몰리 실험</span><span class=\"type\">.txt</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.93KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5859865cad2d72805db43984c13ee2c418a4f128?download\" data-file-name=\"시간팽창.txt\" data-file-size=\"5149\" data-mimetype=\"text/plain\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevQm%26dataid%3D102%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20240123121129&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F5859865cad2d72805db43984c13ee2c418a4f128')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">시간팽창</span><span class=\"type\">.txt</span></div><div class=\"size\">5.03KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
